  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.8.0 adds bounded streaming CSV inspection, import plans, and sample-limited schema inference. It improves CLI CSV and Excel streaming, buffered PipeReader throughput, and resource limits for untrusted CSV and XLSX input. Full changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
